{"id": 4702, "title": "Change of life", "level": "Intermediate", "hsk_tags": ["HSK3"], "slug": "change-of-life", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/4702_change-of-life.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["为了学习汉语，我来到了中国生活。到了新环境意味着我不得不放弃很多东西，比如我亲爱的老朋友和美丽的风景。首先，我必须学会适应陌生的环境。当我有时间，我就会在街上走，熟悉商店和街道。然后我发现了一些有趣的地方，比如一些小咖啡店。小店提供了很多书，我可以在里面看书。我没有多少朋友，我有点孤独，但是我的同学都很好，他们帮助我解决问题。现在我有了很多好朋友，感觉在中国就像在家一样。我会在这里找到更多的惊喜。"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["為了學習漢語，我來到了中國生活。到了新環境意味著我不得不放棄很多東西，比如我親愛的老朋友和美麗的風景。首先，我必須學會適應陌生的環境。當我有時間，我就會在街上走，熟悉商店和街道。然後我發現了一些有趣的地方，比如一些小咖啡店。小店提供了很多書，我可以在裡面看書。我沒有多少朋友，我有點孤獨，但是我的同學都很好，他們幫助我解決問題。現在我有了很多好朋友，感覺在中國就像在家一樣。我會在這裡找到更多的驚喜。"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["wèi le xué xí Hàn yǔ， wǒ lái dào le Zhōng guó shēng huó。 dào le xīn huán jìng yì wèi zhe wǒ bù dé bù fàng qì hěn duō dōng xi， bǐ rú wǒ qīn ài de lǎo péng you hé měi lì de fēng jǐng。 shǒu xiān， wǒ bì xū xué huì shì yìng mò shēng de huán jìng。 dāng wǒ yǒu shí jiān， wǒ jiù huì zài jiē shàng zǒu， shú xi shāng diàn hé jiē dào。 rán hòu wǒ fā xiàn le yī xiē yǒu qù de dì fang， bǐ rú yī xiē xiǎo kā fēi diàn。 xiǎo diàn tí gōng le hěn duō shū， wǒ kě yǐ zài lǐ miàn kàn shū。 wǒ méi yǒu duō shǎo péng you， wǒ yǒu diǎn gū dú， dàn shì wǒ de tóng xué dōu hěn hǎo， tā men bāng zhù wǒ jiě jué wèn tí。 xiàn zài wǒ yǒu le hěn duō hǎo péng you， gǎn jué zài Zhōng guó jiù xiàng zài jiā yī yàng。 wǒ huì zài zhè lǐ zhǎo dào gèng duō de jīng xǐ。"], "english_paragraphs": ["In order to learn Chinese, I came to live in China. Arriving in a new environment meant that I had to give up a lot of things, such as my dear old friends and the beautiful scenery. First, I must learn to adapt to a strange environment. When I have time, I walk on the streets and get familiar with the shops and streets. Then I found some interesting places, like some little coffee shops. The store provides a lot of books, and I can read in them. I don't have many friends and I'm a bit lonely, but my classmates are very nice and they help me solve my problems. Now I have many good friends and feel like I am at home in China. I will find more surprises here."], "english_full": "In order to learn Chinese, I came to live in China. Arriving in a new environment meant that I had to give up a lot of things, such as my dear old friends and the beautiful scenery. First, I must learn to adapt to a strange environment. When I have time, I walk on the streets and get familiar with the shops and streets. Then I found some interesting places, like some little coffee shops. The store provides a lot of books, and I can read in them. I don't have many friends and I'm a bit lonely, but my classmates are very nice and they help me solve my problems. Now I have many good friends and feel like I am at home in China. I will find more surprises here.", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wèi le\" data-defn=\"for; for the purpose of; in order to\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">为了</span><span class=\"tr\">為了</span><rt>wèi le</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xué xí\" data-defn=\"to learn / to study\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">学习</span><span class=\"tr\">學習</span><rt>xué xí</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Hàn yǔ\" data-defn=\"Chinese language\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">汉语</span><span class=\"tr\">漢語</span><rt>Hàn yǔ</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǒ\" data-defn=\"I; me; my\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"lái\" data-defn=\"to come\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">来</span><span class=\"tr\">來</span><rt>lái</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dào\" data-defn=\"to reach; to arrive / to (a place); until (a time); up to (a point) / (verb complement indicating arriving at a place or reaching a point)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">到</span><span class=\"tr\">到</span><rt>dào</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"le\" data-defn=\"(completed action 